@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 使用说明
# 1. 建议先运行 00-seed-data.http
# 2. 本文件会先创建两个“无记录的新作品”
# 3. 先预览记录导入，再正式导入

### 1. 创建记录导入专用作品A
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titleCn": "记录导入专用作品A",
  "displayTitle": "记录导入专用作品A",
  "releaseYear": 2026,
  "releaseQuarter": 1,
  "category": "ANIME",
  "studioName": "Import Record Studio",
  "platformLink": "https://example.com/record-import-a",
  "status": "NORMAL"
}

### 2. 创建记录导入专用作品B
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titleCn": "记录导入专用作品B",
  "displayTitle": "记录导入专用作品B",
  "releaseYear": 2026,
  "releaseQuarter": 2,
  "category": "COMIC",
  "studioName": "Import Record Studio",
  "platformLink": "https://example.com/record-import-b",
  "status": "NORMAL"
}

### 3. 预览批量导入记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records/import/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "记录导入专用作品A",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 1,
      "subjectCategory": "ANIME",
      "scoreValue": 44,
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 1,
      "note": "记录导入成功样例A"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "记录导入专用作品B",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 2,
      "subjectCategory": "COMIC",
      "scoreValue": 36,
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 2,
      "note": "记录导入成功样例B"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "进击的巨人 The Final Season Part 1",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2020,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 4,
      "subjectCategory": "ANIME",
      "scoreValue": 48,
      "recordYear": 2024,
      "recordQuarter": 1,
      "note": "已存在记录，应跳过"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "根本不存在的作品",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 3,
      "subjectCategory": "NOVEL",
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 3,
      "note": "作品不存在，应跳过"
    }
  ]
}

### 4. 正式批量导入记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "记录导入专用作品A",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 1,
      "subjectCategory": "ANIME",
      "scoreValue": 44,
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 1,
      "note": "记录导入成功样例A"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "记录导入专用作品B",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 2,
      "subjectCategory": "COMIC",
      "scoreValue": 36,
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 2,
      "note": "记录导入成功样例B"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "进击的巨人 The Final Season Part 1",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2020,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 4,
      "subjectCategory": "ANIME",
      "scoreValue": 48,
      "recordYear": 2024,
      "recordQuarter": 1,
      "note": "已存在记录，应跳过"
    },
    {
      "subjectDisplayTitle": "根本不存在的作品",
      "subjectReleaseYear": 2026,
      "subjectReleaseQuarter": 3,
      "subjectCategory": "NOVEL",
      "recordYear": 2026,
      "recordQuarter": 3,
      "note": "作品不存在，应跳过"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. 查询 2026 年记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records?year=2026
